  "result": "Excellent! All 179 tests pass. I've added comprehensive voucher support:\n\n**`applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })`** \u2014 Applies a fixed-amount voucher to an invoice\n- Validates status is 'draft' (error: NOT_DRAFT)\n- Prevents multiple vouchers per invoice (error: VOUCHER_EXISTS)\n- Validates amount is positive integer in cents (error: AMOUNT_INVALID)\n- Sets `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with voucher applied\n\n**Updated `invoiceTotals`** \u2014 Now includes voucher in calculations\n- Returns: `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- Formula: `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher`\n- Voucher is applied AFTER VAT (reduces final total)\n- Clamped at 0 (never goes negative)\n\n**New error code:**\n- `VOUCHER_EXISTS` \u2014 Only one voucher per invoice\n\n**Example workflow:**\n```javascript\nconst inv = createInvoice({\n  customerId: 'C-001',\n  issueDate: '2026-10-07',\n  lines: [{ sku: 'DEV-HOUR', qty: 100 }]\n}).value;\n\nconst totals = invoiceTotals(inv);\nconsole.log(totals.total); // \u20ac1,200.00\n\n// Apply 10% off voucher\nconst withVoucher = applyVoucher(inv, {\n  code: 'SAVE10',\n  amount: 50000  // \u20ac500.00 off\n}).value;\n\nconst newTotals = invoiceTotals(withVoucher);\nconsole.log(newTotals.voucher); // \u20ac500.00\nconsole.log(newTotals.total);   // \u20ac700.00\n```\n\n**Test coverage:** 9 new tests covering:\n- Applying vouchers to draft invoices\n- Total reduction with vouchers\n- Error cases (NOT_DRAFT, VOUCHER_EXISTS, AMOUNT_INVALID)\n- Integration with discounts and VAT\n- Input immutability\n\nAll 179 tests pass \u2713",
